.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YbHy2PdiktUQ7kNvwGnR3vO&_nc_oc=AdnvaT5amO57JHm9XFExxFj4MDxErwSVuOLAyzdP-I6qRnVFsPUv8A_S1CDnroTfkfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzx73qN-xheEInss-SyiXzOA15O_gnPUIDdRkbfDyRa0A&oe=69B55F18"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQCwQ5Iydh8Q7kNvwE_g7SX&_nc_oc=AdnefqTJHiuEigqtU5yfMT0Zj-evqNMSmsnXe99oXlAJ0zI9gFfOHkOxtD1Cv8GExsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxhlx_5KWqe4-f76yitq05fQVRxIdXWNLAg9FG-IslJhg&oe=69B55C40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=evPBV7kp-9IQ7kNvwHV9g0c&_nc_oc=Adl7KYJokazaVZdgDjEpmssqVXIRvqZmVs1_9Yv2IwG-3jaWg48YNXTD86cAz8gXwRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz0ultyIpulC2jO0XDvyGPz1_7ggnqhY4EWLT_n8D9QEQ&oe=69B55C73"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p